[grpc_config]
Target:localhost:50053
Endpoint:ai.AIService/GenerateText
Data:`
    {
        "uuid": {RANDOM oneof=int},
        "prompt": "Hello",
        "system_prompt": "",
        "request_trace": "{RANDOM oneof=uuid}"
    }
`
ProtoPath:{VARIABLE key=aisrvproto ; default=../protos/ai.proto}
ID:0
Type:grpc
Timeout:20s
Certs:{VARIABLE key=cacrt ; default=../gateway/ssl/ca.crt}
Response:InvokeRpc is for unary methods; "ai.AIService.GenerateText" is server-streaming
[\grpc_config]

